{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"がっつり質問答えてきま～す"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/01/120201_132001.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．愛未の好きな男性のタイプは？\nＡ.良い香りがして、あみの事だーけ好きでいてくれて、清潔感がある人"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｷｭﾝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．好きなアーティストさんは誰ですか？\nＡ.AKB48さんはもちろん、清水翔太さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん素敵です!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．「マリーナホップ」へ行ってみての感想は？\nＡ.皆さんすごく暖かくてですね、広島について一番最初がマリーナホップだったから不安だらけだったのに、皆さん優しく迎えてくださっても～あみは心がポッカポカ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．アニーのオーディションはもう受けないの？\nＡ.アニーは一応年齢制限がありまして、あみはもう制限オーバーしちゃってるので受けられまへん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．最近オススメの曲は何ですか？\nＡ.清水翔太さんの「冬が終わる前に」とかかな??うん最近よく聞いてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．好きな男性のファッションは?\nＡ.ストール好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豹柄とかオシャレに取り入れちゃうの素敵だと思います…"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．ズバリ、あみチャンの魅力って何だと思いますか？\nＡ.魅力かあ…何にでも好奇心旺盛に挑戦出来るとこ？…自分で言っちゃったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/smile.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．一番仲良しなメンバは誰？Ｑ．メンバーで特に仲いいのは誰!?\nＡ.とくにこの子っていうのがなくて、ん～あみ本当に皆大好きだから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬さんにはよくお世話になってます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．あみちゃん美容院はいつも同じところに行くタイプ？\nＡ.基本同じ所です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．どこのワンピースですか？\nＡ.このワンピはママが買ってきてくれた物だからわかんない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度聞いてみる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．あみたんはダイビングとか興味あるかな？\nＡ.あるーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超やってみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ答えきれてない質問や新しい質問は明後日するに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}